# Hand-written public Swift types of the module Polyjose (platforms/swift/Sources/Polyjose, any file
# but the generated Polyjose.swift), with their public members (scripts/check-binding-api.sh,
# "Host-type lists"; ADR 0071 §5). The swift mode fails on any hand-written public type or member
# not listed here, and on a listed one the sources lack.
#
#   type <Name>      a public type
#     member <name>  one of its public members (func, var, let, init, subscript, nested type, case)
#
# Adding a type is a review decision, like an inventory change.

# AppleKey (ADR 0072 §1, feature 0025 T03): the members of ADR 0072 §1, the three PlatformKey
# methods its conformance needs, its two nested types and the three printing members (ADR 0071 §7).
type AppleKey
  member Protection
  member Access
  member generate
  member open
  member delete
  member init
  member publicJwk
  member algorithms
  member protection
  member sign
  member agree
  member decryptKey
  member description
  member debugDescription
  member customMirror
